---
title: "Projects | Texas Aerial Robotics"
description: "The 2026-2027 Texas Aerial Robotics project teams: claw retrieval, thrust vector control dart, color vision targeting, and the RTX drone competition."
ogDescription: "The 2026-2027 Texas Aerial Robotics project teams."
navKey: "projects"
scripts: ["carousel.js"]
---

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">Projects</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        One goal: aerial robots that can sense, decide, and act without a
        pilot. Every member joins a project team and works on it from the
        first week.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===============================================================
       THE PROJECT TEAMS

       Written in src/content/projects-current.txt. Edit that file to add,
       remove, or reword a project. The bands stripe themselves light and
       dark, so however many there are, the page keeps its rhythm.
       =============================================================== -->
  {%- for project in projects.current %}
  <section
    class="section section--{{ "light" if loop.index0 % 2 == 0 else "muted" }}"
    id="{{ project.link }}"
  >
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split split--photo">
        <div class="reveal">
          {%- if project.photo %}
          <img class="project-photo" src="{{ project.photo }}" alt="{{ project.name }}" loading="lazy" />
          {%- else %}
          <div class="photo-slot photo-slot--large"><span class="photo-slot__name">{{ project.name }}</span><span class="photo-slot__note">Photo coming</span></div>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>{{ project.name }}</h2>
          <p class="lede">{{ project.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endfor %}

  <!-- ===============================================================
       RTX DRONE COMPETITION
       This year's task comes from src/content/ravg-competition.txt.
       Full write-up lives on ravg.html.
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--dark" id="rtx">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2>RTX Drone Competition</h2>
        <p class="lede">{{ ravg.task.overview }}</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/ravg.html"
            >Go to the RAVG page</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===============================================================
       PAST MISSIONS

       A carousel: it scrolls on its own and can also be dragged,
       swiped, or stepped through with the arrows and dots.
       Behaviour is in assets/js/carousel.js; the dots are generated
       there, so adding a card here needs no other change.
       Change data-carousel-interval to speed it up or slow it down.
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--muted" id="archive">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <h2>Past projects</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Earlier project teams, and the International Aerial Robotics
          Competition missions we flew against top universities from around
          the world.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="carousel" data-carousel data-carousel-interval="5000">
        <!-- Cards come from src/content/projects-past.txt. Edit that
             file; the dots below count themselves. -->
        <div
          class="carousel__track"
          tabindex="0"
          role="region"
          aria-label="Past missions"
        >
          {%- for project in projects.past %}
          <article class="card">
            <p class="card__index">{{ project.when }}</p>
            <h3 class="card__title">{{ project.name }}</h3>
            <p class="card__body">{{ project.description }}</p>
          </article>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>

        <div class="carousel__controls">
          <button
            class="carousel__button carousel__button--prev"
            type="button"
            data-carousel-prev
            aria-label="Previous past missions"
          >
            <span class="icon icon--chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>

          <div class="carousel__dots" data-carousel-dots></div>

          <button
            class="carousel__button carousel__button--next"
            type="button"
            data-carousel-next
            aria-label="Next past missions"
          >
            <span
              class="icon icon--chevron-right"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h2>Have a project idea?</h2>
      <p>
        Members pitch and lead new projects every year. Tell us what you
        want to build.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact.html">Talk to us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
